I enter the office.
Due to the heavy rain, my umbrella is completely wet.
I go to the breakroom to keep my bag.
Rohan, Priya, and Suresh are there.
Suresh is my manager, but in our office we address by name.
Seeing me, they all smile.
"Happy birthday Maya!" they say loudly.
I look at the counter in surprise.
There is a beautiful cake there.
Rohan says, "Maya, I ordered this cake just yesterday."
Priya says, "Yes, even in such rainy weather today, it has finally arrived."
Suresh says, "Maya, you came to Mumbai just for work."
"But today we have organized this small surprise for you."
I am very emotional.
"I have never celebrated my birthday in the office before," I tell them.
"Thank you everyone for this surprise."
We all cut the cake together.
It is very delicious, and my day starts beautifully.
